field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="images" type="multiComplex"><complex-values><field id="imageURL" type="input"><value>//sc04.alicdn.com/kf/H5adec26a19b0441d99f3314963a91222K/286385890/H5adec26a19b0441d99f3314963a91222K.png</value></field></complex-values></field><field id="gallery" type="singleCheck"><value displayName="Detail shot">300</value></field></complex-values></field><field id="textDesc" type="input"><value>Dial-and-cord closure: A rotary dial draws the front cord through paired fabric guides, offering an alternative to traditional tied laces.
Layered upper design: Grained stitched overlays frame the mesh sections on the toe and side panels for a clearly defined outdoor-style appearance.
Low-top profile: A dark textile collar and rear pull loop accompany the rounded black forefoot overlay.
