hipping specifications">700</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="images" type="multiComplex"><complex-values><field id="imageURL" type="input"><value>//sc04.alicdn.com/kf/H7d0669b743e742c1a97e8108e6cc96eaV/286385890/H7d0669b743e742c1a97e8108e6cc96eaV.png</value></field></complex-values></field><field id="gallery" type="singleCheck"><value displayName="Packaging &amp; shipping specifications">700</value></field></complex-values></field><field id="companyDesc" type="input"><value>Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear &amp; Apparel Co., Ltd. is a footwear manufacturer based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We work with importers, wholesalers, brand owners and e-commerce businesses on wholesale and OEM/ODM footwear projects. From selecting existing styles to developing a design brief, reviewing samples and planning packaging, we help buyers turn their requirements into a clear order plan. Share your product direction and purchasing needs to discuss a suitable cooperation proposal.</value></field><field id="companyFaqDesc" type="multiComplex"><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>Are you a factory or a trading company?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>We are a footwear manufacturer based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We work with overseas B2B buyers on wholesale and OEM/ODM footwear projects.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>What is your minimum order quantity?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>Small trial orders are welcome for existing styles; the minimum quantity is shown on each product page. For custom orders, the MOQ depends on the design, materials, branding and packaging.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>Can I mix colors and sizes in one order?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>Yes. Mixed colors and sizes are supported for existing styles. Mixed-style orders can also be discussed according to the selected styles and order quantity.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>Can I order samples before a bulk order?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>Yes. Samples can be arranged for you to check the workmanship and fit before bulk ordering. Sample and courier costs are quoted before payment.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>What packaging options do you offer?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>Shoe boxes and polybags are available packing options. Custom boxes, labels and carton markings can be planned around your order and brand requirements.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>Do you support logo customization and OEM/ODM?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>Yes. We work with buyers on branding and footwear development. Send your logo artwork or design reference, target quantity and market requirements so we can develop a suitable proposal.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>What is the lead time?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>Lead time depends on product availability, order quantity and customization. Existing styles can usually be arranged sooner; the production or dispatch schedule is agreed when confirming the order.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>How can you arrange shipping?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>Samples and small shipments can use express courier. Bulk shipments can be planned by sea or air, or through your appointed forwarder. Send your destination and delivery target for a freight quotation.</value></field></complex-values></field><field id="logisticsProperty" type="multiCheck"><values><value>general_cargo_0</value></values></field></itemSchema>